{"id":"ground-answer-from-tool","category":"grounding","gate":"hard","why":"回答具体内容前必须先查。这里确认工具真的被执行且结果进了上下文","user_text":"我这周有什么要做的？","fixtures":{"tasks":[{"title":"写季度报告"}]},"script":[{"tool_calls":[{"name":"tasks.search","arguments":{"status":["todo"]}}]},{"content":"你还有一件事没做完：写季度报告。"}],"expect":{"executed_tools":["tasks.search"],"tool_result_contains":["写季度报告"],"answer_contains":["写季度报告"]}}
{"id":"ground-no-evidence-refuses","category":"grounding","gate":"hard","why":"查不到东西时必须说查不到，不能编。这里工具返回空，回答不得出现具体条目","user_text":"我这周有什么要做的？","fixtures":{"tasks":[]},"script":[{"tool_calls":[{"name":"tasks.search","arguments":{"status":["todo"]}}]},{"content":"你现在没有待办。"}],"expect":{"executed_tools":["tasks.search"],"tool_result_contains":["\"count\":0"],"proposals":0}}
{"id":"ground-aggregate-from-sql","category":"grounding","gate":"hard","why":"聚合数字必须来自 SQL，不能让模型自己加。没有数值记录时要明说不要下结论","user_text":"这个月吃饭花了多少？","fixtures":{"ledger_records":[{"amount":38.5,"category":"餐饮"},{"amount":61.5,"category":"餐饮"}]},"script":[{"tool_calls":[{"name":"records.aggregate","arguments":{"tracker_id":"$LEDGER","field_key":"amount"}}]},{"content":"这个月餐饮一共 100 元。"}],"expect":{"executed_tools":["records.aggregate"],"tool_result_contains":["\"total\":100"]}}
{"id":"ground-aggregate-empty-warns","category":"grounding","gate":"hard","why":"没有数值记录时统计值全是 0，直接报出去会变成「这个月花了 0 元」这种假答案","user_text":"这个月吃饭花了多少？","fixtures":{"ledger_records":[]},"script":[{"tool_calls":[{"name":"records.aggregate","arguments":{"tracker_id":"$LEDGER","field_key":"amount"}}]},{"content":"这段时间没有记录。"}],"expect":{"executed_tools":["records.aggregate"],"tool_result_contains":["不要给出统计结论"],"tool_result_omits":["\"total\""]}}
{"id":"ground-source-refs-resolvable","category":"grounding","gate":"hard","why":"工具返回的 source_refs 必须指向真实存在的对象，客户端要靠它跳转","user_text":"我这周有什么要做的？","fixtures":{"tasks":[{"title":"写季度报告"}]},"script":[{"tool_calls":[{"name":"tasks.search","arguments":{"status":["todo"]}}]},{"content":"有一件。"}],"expect":{"executed_tools":["tasks.search"],"tool_sources_resolvable":true}}
{"id":"ground-unscheduled-tasks","category":"grounding","gate":"hard","why":"询问随时可做任务时必须使用无日期筛选，不能把有截止日期的任务混进来","user_text":"我现在有什么随时可做的任务？","fixtures":{"tasks":[{"title":"整理旧照片"}]},"script":[{"tool_calls":[{"name":"tasks.search","arguments":{"unscheduled":true}}]},{"content":"你有一件随时可做的任务：整理旧照片。"}],"expect":{"executed_tools":["tasks.search"],"tool_result_contains":["整理旧照片"],"answer_contains":["整理旧照片"]}}
